    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37154" root="كلب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلْتَبَانٌ</span></b>  <i>A pimp:</i> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلِبَ</span>, q. v., (As, IAar,
K) Sb, however, does not mention the measure
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعْتَلَانٌ</span>. ISd thinks it most probable that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلِبَ</span>
is a triliteral-radical, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلتبان</span> a quadriliteralradical [or rather a quasi-quadriliteral-radical],
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرِمَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِزْرَأَمّ</span> &amp;c. (L.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْطَبَانٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْتَبَانٌ</span>, and art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلتب</span>.

